I need to fix this in the QA-only routing block in owner-ai.ts — add the same terminal-job-status detection I added for the read-only inspection. Let me fix that, then re-run the live cert test 2 and run live cert test 1 (code-change).

Actually, looking at the QA answer more carefully — it shows the QA runtime DID run (status=completed, stage=COMPLETED, category=qa, taskId created) but the rendered answer is the "still running" placeholder, not the terminal answer. This is because the job reached terminal but the `runIVXQAOnly` re-run happened too late OR the answer rendering logic has the same bug.

Looking at my QA-only block in owner-ai.ts:
```
if (qaJob.result && qaIsTerminal(qaJob.status)) {
  qaOnlyProof = await runIVXQAOnly({ goal: prompt });
